@prefix fc: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/fleet-contract#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
fc:Projection a rdf:Class . fc:AdapterFamily a rdf:Class .
fc:subject a rdf:Property . fc:consumer a rdf:Property . fc:workId a rdf:Property .
fc:targetRepository a rdf:Property . fc:targetPath a rdf:Property .
fc:artifactKind a rdf:Property . fc:contractVersion a rdf:Property .
fc:adapterFamily a rdf:Property . fc:templateKey a rdf:Property .